{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"解析函子"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"解析函子 (算畴理论)"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><strong>解析函子</strong>是解析函数 (形式幂级数) 的"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴化","text":"范畴化"}},{"Plain":", 有多个不同场合的相互关联的概念.</p>\n<p>注意这个概念不同于 "},{"Local":{"url":"Goodwillie演算","text":"Goodwillie 演算"}},{"Plain":"中的"},{"Local":{"url":"解析函子(Goodwillie)","text":"解析函子"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>生象范畴上</h3>\n<p>参考 "},{"Local":{"url":"GHK-analytic-monads","text":"Gepner–Haugseng–Kock"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>考虑"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":"的范畴 "},{"Local":{"url":"Ani","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}$"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>. 称保持"},{"Local":{"url":"弱可缩范畴","text":"弱可缩"}},{"Plain":"极限与"},{"Local":{"url":"筛余极限","text":"筛余极限"}},{"Plain":"的函子 $\\mathsf{Ani}_{/I} \\to \\mathsf{Ani}_{/J}$ 为<strong>解析函子</strong>.</p>\n<p>下面的命题为理解上述定义提供了重要的直观.</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 函子 $F\\colon \\mathsf{Ani} \\to \\mathsf{Ani}$ 为解析函子, 当且仅当 $F$ 为其在 $\\mathsf{Fin}^{\\simeq}$ 上的限制的"},{"Local":{"url":"Kan扩张","text":"左 Kan 扩张"}},{"Plain":", 也即有如下 “Taylor 展开”\n$$\r\nF(A) = \\int_{N\\in\\mathsf{Fin}^{\\simeq}}F(N)\\times A^N = \\bigsqcup_{N\\geq 0}F(N)\\times_{S_N}A^N.\r\n$$\n其中 $S_N$ 表示"},{"Local":{"url":"对称群","text":"对称群"}},{"Plain":", 作用于 $F(N)$ 与 $A^N$ 上.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>与多项式函子的关系</h3>\n<p>见"},{"Local":{"url":"多项式函子","text":"多项式函子"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}